/* Negative test: an additive property cannot be declared `array<T>`. A tracked array keeps its
   length in a trailing slot; an additive property accumulates, so that slot would land inside
   the accumulated data. Only the raw form can hold one. */
// EXPECT_ERROR: an additive property accumulates
// EXPECT_ERROR: Declare it `rawArray<T>`
